    "RerankConfig": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "Reranking 精排配置（Step 4: 二阶段精排）\n\nprovider = \"cross_encoder\" → BGE-Reranker-v2-m3（需要 pip install sentence-transformers）\nprovider = \"llm\"           → 复用现有 LLM 做相关性评分（开箱即用，推荐）",
